 You can select a tile resolution mode upon starting a <i>New Game </i>(no restart required). Historical states and provinces are not implemented; only procedural tiles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Normal </strong>tile density mode has the default tile resolution:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867100/extras/2290bdd6172f5324fa9c7c5093facba9.avif?t=1774813260\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867100/extras_big/2290bdd6172f5324fa9c7c5093facba9.webp?t=1774813260 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Quad </strong>resolution mode features a 4x increase in tile resolution, offering better visuals and more accurate borders (also 4x GPU VRAM usage):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867100/extras/29b0535a7186c899002a1270e86d5aff.avif?t=1774813260\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867100/extras_big/29b0535a7186c899002a1270e86d5aff.webp?t=1774813260 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nation Selection </strong>– Choose any nation currently available, from the British Empire to the Ottoman Empire or the microstates of San Marino and Liechtenstein.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867100/extras/a0d81a4b8e632eccd52df5fd2e072522.avif?t=1774813260\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867100/extras_big/a0d81a4b8e632eccd52df5fd2e072522.webp?t=1774813260 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stron